                                "sense_id": "b7fff848-b40d-32fc-91e5-aaa5b1ad31f3",
                                "text": "We did have some success with uracil when we would preincorporate the uracil into a mutant of E. coli that had a uracil requirement and then feed this cellular content from E. coli."
